participant Analyst "Analyst" actor
participant Agent "AI Agent"
participant MCP "MCP Tools"
participant TI "Threat Intel DB"
msg Analyst -> Agent solid filled #1 "Request IP attribution"
msg Agent -> MCP solid filled #2 "Call lookup_ip & check_ip"
msg MCP -> TI solid filled #3 "Query Passive Cache & Reputation"
msg TI -> MCP dotted filled #4 "Return ASN, Abuse Score, Geo"
msg MCP -> Agent dotted filled #5 "Formatted JSON Result"
msg Agent -> Analyst solid filled #6 "Present Report & Attribution Verdict"
